                    response: I propose fine-tuning a                           
                    pretrained ResNet18 model for binary                        
                    classification of malignant vs.                             
                    non-malignant (combining benign and                         
                    non-neoplastic). We perform 5-fold                          
                    stratified cross-validation on the                          
                    dataset, computing AUROC on each                            
                    fold's validation set and reporting                         
                    the mean and standard deviation.                            
                    Images are loaded via a custom PyTorch                      
                    Dataset with standard 224×224 resizing                      
                    and ImageNet normalization. A                               
                    predict() function is provided to                           
