                    and 1 for each image that the image                         
                    shows a malignant skin lesion.                              
                                                                                
                    ## Task evaluation                                          
                                                                                
                    Area under the receiver operator curve                      
                    (AUROC)                                                     
                                                                                
                    # Memory                                                    
                                                                                
                    Design: We can work around the missing                      
                    xgboost dependency by switching to                          
                    sklearn’s RandomForestClassifier for                        
                    our tabular model on top of the                             
                    ResNet50 features. We’ll extract                            
                    features as before, then perform a                          
                    5-fold stratified CV with RandomForest,                     
                    reporting per-fold and mean AUROC.                          
                    Finally, we retrain on all data and                         
                    generate test predictions saved to                          
                    `./working/submission.csv`. The                             
                    `predict()` function stays as before,                       
                    now using RandomForest proba outputs.                       
                    Results: The code successfully                              
                    extracted features from all images                          
                    using a pretrained ResNet50 model and                       
                    trained a RandomForest classifier with                      
                    5-fold cross-validation. The feature                        
                    extraction process was slow but                             
                    completed without errors. The script                        
                    saved the final submission CSV with                         
                    predicted malignant probabilities.                          
