                    pipeline ran successfully without                           
                    errors. Using a ResNet50 backbone for                       
                    feature extraction and a stratified                         
                    5-fold cross-validation with an MLP                         
                    classifier, the model achieved a mean                       
                    AUROC of 0.8731 with a low standard                         
