                    successfully without any errors. The                        
                    model achieved a mean ROC AUC of                            
                    approximately 0.8585 in 5-fold                              
                    cross-validation, indicating good                           
                    performance in distinguishing malignant                     
                    from benign skin lesions. The feature                       
                    extraction using a pretrained ResNet18                      
                    followed by LightGBM classification was                     
                    effective for this task.                                    
